    {
      "id": "claim_b6955ee1d1bc49178d7ede377cf4c529",
      "statement": "Malformed OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_EXTRA_HEADERS fails fast rather than degrading silently: create_app calls parse_extra_headers before building the app (pinned by tests/test_provider_proxy.py::test_create_app_rejects_invalid_extra_headers) and WorkerLoop.start parses it before deciding whether to start the proxy.",
