    {
      "id": "claim_6c04d39d115449918031689f96cf484e",
      "statement": "Upload limits are enforced with two variables: MAX_UPLOAD_MB (default 200) caps the streamed upload size in save_upload, aborting the request with 413, while MAX_EXTRACTED_MB (default 1024) caps the summed uncompressed size of the archive entries before extraction, protecting against decompression bombs.",
